          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. 某蛋白样品，经 Chymotrypsin 酶解，从 N 端裂解下多肽 A，对多肽 A 所作的实验结果如下:"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "index": 26,
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.667,
            0.824,
            0.757
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 27,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.667,
                0.631,
                0.683
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "a）完全水解后得 Glu: Leu: Lys: Pro: Phe=1: 2: 2: 1: 1;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 28,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.686,
                0.663,
                0.701
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "b）以 FDNB 处理继以酸水解，得到 DNP-Glu : ε-DNP-Lys=1:2;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 29,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.704,
                0.822,
                0.72
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "c）以 Trypsin 处理后再进行 FDNB 处理，得到三个新的 DNP 衍生物，分别为 B、C、D；"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 30,
              "bbox": [
                0.147,
                0.723,
                0.554,
                0.738
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "d）B肽段经完全酸水解后得DNP-Leu和Pro、Phe;"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "index": 31,
              "bbox": [
                0.146,
                0.741,
                0.787,
                0.757
              ],
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "e）C肽段经酸水解得DNP-Leu、"
                },
                {
                  "type": "equation_inline",
                  "content": "\\varepsilon"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "-DNP-Lys和Glu，试求多肽A的顺序。（5分）"
                }
              ]
